CRT post-process shaders for the OpenGL drawmode ([Arcade], see
docs/arcade/crt-shaders.md).  Taken unmodified from libretro's glsl-shaders
collection (crt/shaders/), apart from zfast_crt.glsl's line endings:

  zfast_crt.glsl   Greg Hogan (SoltanGris42)   GPL v2 or later
  crt-pi.glsl      davej                       GPL v2 or later
  crt-lottes.glsl  Timothy Lottes              public domain
  crt-geom.glsl    cgwg, Themaister, DOLLS     GPL v2 or later

They are compiled into the program through ../ogl_crt_glsl.h, which
tools/glsl2c.py regenerates.  Edit a .glsl here and re-run it; never edit the
header by hand.
